WEBVTT

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:31.490
Catherine, Catherine.
Catherine, you intelligent child.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:33.760
Do you understand?

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:39.700
Truth is the only path to happiness for man.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:45.540
Let us seek out truth together, Catherine.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.030
Yes, Teacher!

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:51.810
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:55.780
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:58.290
<i>You are my star</i>

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:02.790
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:08.600
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:20.640
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:27.950
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:33.490
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:40.620
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:46.100
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.540
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:55.480
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:57.750
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:01.820
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:04.320
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:08.860
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:14.660
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:17.560
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:48.020
Takius-<i>san</i>, isn't there an easier road?!

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:55.340
I don't mind going there, but Morok's not that way.

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:56.000
Wha-

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.440
Hah?!

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:02.640
It's so hot.
Let's just go someplace cool!

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:07.520
Hey! What're are you looking at?

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:08.650
Oh! Uh, I-

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:11.620
All Roan can think of is you, Yuufa.

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:14.820
Don't get too big for your britches, Maaya.

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:17.160
Takius-<i>san</i>, where are we going?

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:22.650
That's right. Didn't you want to get to the desert in order to go to Morok?

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:27.670
Hey, say something, will you?!

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:36.840
Weird monster.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:38.350
It's gone.

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:39.180
We're here.

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:40.010
Huh?

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.680
Wait for me!

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:55.690
Wow!

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:05.410
What is this?

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:09.580
Let me see, too! What's this?

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:11.310
I don't like the looks of it.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.490
He went and fell!

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:22.690
My merchandise had better not be damaged!

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:23.990
Roan!

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:38.240
My merchandise!
My merchandise is ruined!

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:39.840
Are you all right, Roan?

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:42.540
Y-Yes. What is this, anyway?

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:45.340
This is the entrance to the ant nest.

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:51.320
People call this "Ant Hell."

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:52.690
"Ant Hell..."

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:55.350
Is this your intended destination?

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:01.860
Hey!

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:03.630
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:08.000
Where are you going?!

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:10.840
Is there something in here that we can sell?

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:12.970
But isn't this an ants' nest?

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:14.110
I'm not going!

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:16.300
Wait, Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:28.820
Ow, ow, ow. Huh?

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:30.120
What's this?

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:33.760
Hey! Watch those hands!

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:36.400
Oww!

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:39.330
You've got it all wrong!
It wasn't intentional-

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:54.010
It's beautiful!

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:08.960
The ants' world...
A totally different world!

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:19.510
No! If we don't attack them, they won't bother us.

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:21.310
B-But...

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:28.640
Let's go.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:34.990
Are you all right?
If you're hurt, let me know.

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:37.020
I'll look after you.

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:40.320
Please stop bothering
Big Brother Iruga!

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:43.500
We're connected this way.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:46.470
It's an adult relationship.

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:51.670
But I don't suppose a sheltered girl like you would understand.

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:56.340
Let's go, too.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:33.650
Eggs...

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:37.220
I wonder if we could sell them for a lot.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.290
It's probably impossible.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:38.950
Huh?

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:44.190
If even one of these ants is threatened, they'll all attack.

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:45.930
All of them?

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:47.990
Scary!

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:09.270
Oh! It hatched!

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:15.260
Ohh! It's adorable!

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:16.950
What part?

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:21.300
Over here, too!

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:41.980
You!

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:43.020
Wait.

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:46.890
This one seems to think
Yuufa is its mommy.

00:08:46.890 --> 00:08:49.020
--Huh?
--Hah?!

00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:49.960
'Scuse me.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.190
Poring!

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:54.320
Sis, a birthday present for the baby.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.660
It's so cute!

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.590
Thank you for your patronage!

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:24.630
Where're you going?

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:26.960
Let's follow them.

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:19.350
What's that? An Ant Monster?

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:23.050
She is the queen of this ants' nest... Maya.

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:24.680
Maya?

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:48.380
What's happening?

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:49.710
Takius-<i>san</i>?

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:52.710
This is...

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:58.250
This is the egg-laying rite.

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:01.420
Egg-laying rite?

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:06.390
They say that Maya lays over a thousand eggs in a day.

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:08.330
But once a year,

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:13.670
when the full moon is directly overhead, she lays a special egg.

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:15.770
Special?

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.910
Yes. The egg of the successor queen.

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:21.670
The successor queen?

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:28.720
The egg-laying rite...

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:31.390
And today is the day, right?

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:33.350
That's right.

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:39.730
You know a great many things after all, don't you, Takius-<i>san</i>?

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:40.730
Truly.

00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:43.500
What? Did I say something?

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:44.020
Huh?

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:24.070
Isn't it out, yet? I'm hungry.

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.070
Poring.

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:26.870
It won't be long now.

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:29.480
You don't get to see something like this every day.

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:32.780
Or shall I make a pancake with the egg?

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:34.340
Huh, Iruga?

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:38.290
You're so cute!

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:41.360
Will you stop teasing
Big Brother Iruga?

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.860
Now, now.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:46.690
This won't earn me any money.

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:50.020
It's begun.

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:09.970
Don't worry. It's all right.

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:40.670
The egg!

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:46.020
Isn't that wonderful?

00:14:03.370 --> 00:14:06.970
I never dreamed there was such a world under the desert.

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:08.310
Right.

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:33.320
Pardon me!
Please select your destination.

00:15:00.260 --> 00:15:04.960
Catherine, look at this town in ruins.

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:14.240
There must be no more tragedies like the destruction of this town.

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:19.980
That is why we must acquire the truth as soon as possible, Catherine.

00:15:23.180 --> 00:15:25.290
Ohh, I'd forgotten.

00:15:25.290 --> 00:15:30.990
From now on, you are no longer "Catherine."
I must address you as... Takius-<i>kun.</i>

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:36.130
Takius-<i>kun</i>, I give this to you.

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:39.930
So that you need not see the evils of this world.

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:44.340
Let us walk the path of truth together, Takius-<i>kun...</i>

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.340
Teacher...

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:59.020
It is all... for the sake of truth.

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:06.950
What's wrong?

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:10.200
What is it?

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:12.130
Huh? Where's Takius-<i>san</i>?

00:16:13.230 --> 00:16:14.340
Over there.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:15.630
Huh?

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:29.310
What's she planning to do?

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:33.980
Don't!!

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:48.660
Ow!

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:52.810
You dirty!

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:53.870
No!

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:02.320
Takius-<i>san</i>?!

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:03.980
What've you done?!

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:06.610
I... I was...

00:17:09.390 --> 00:17:10.390
Run!

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:11.930
B-But...

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:13.860
Run! We'll be killed!

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:14.950
Wait for me!

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:17.330
Let's go!

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:18.630
Takius!

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:22.970
--I was...
--What're you doing?!

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:30.680
Why'd you save her?
She started this...

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:34.980
Discuss that later. We need her power to get out of here!

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:53.470
Roan!

00:17:53.470 --> 00:17:55.240
Yeah, but...

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:57.330
Come on, do it!

00:17:58.810 --> 00:18:01.940
Frost Diver!

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:09.780
One more!

00:18:12.350 --> 00:18:13.950
Cold Bolt!

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:22.130
We're almost there!

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:23.290
Move it!

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:41.820
Damn you!

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:44.420
Don't! It was our fault!

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:45.980
But we'll die!

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:49.650
Look out!

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:52.590
Roan!

00:18:52.590 --> 00:18:53.650
You dirty!

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:09.610
Roan!

00:19:10.740 --> 00:19:12.150
Sis! Use "Heal"!

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:13.940
B-But...

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:17.280
Sis!

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:18.620
Heal!

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:23.290
Thank you!

00:19:39.670 --> 00:19:40.970
Don't!

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:44.300
Don't!

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:02.330
Stop it!!

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:06.990
Angelus!

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:16.340
The Maya is in her death throes.

00:20:56.320 --> 00:20:58.050
Yuufa...

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:04.260
What have we done?

00:21:04.260 --> 00:21:09.990
But we had to do it.
We would have been killed...

00:21:16.800 --> 00:21:21.940
Heal!

00:21:21.940 --> 00:21:23.340
It's no use.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:31.350
Why?! Why?!

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:33.320
Why'd you do that?!

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:36.260
This is all your fault!

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:41.020
I... I did it all for the sake of truth!

00:21:56.540 --> 00:22:02.480
<i>Truth... What is it, anyway,</i>
<i>Master Zephyrus?</i>

00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:19.370
It won't be long now!
It won't be long now!

00:22:19.370 --> 00:22:24.040
In just a short while,
I'll have truth in the palm of my hand!

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:27.340
It won't be long now, Takius-<i>kun</i>!

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.540 --> 00:23:33.340
<i>This is Teilin of Kapra Service.</i>

00:23:33.340 --> 00:23:36.010
<i>King Osiris sleeps in</i> <i>the pyramid at Morok.</i>

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:40.550
<i>But greedy men opened</i> <i>the door to danger.</i>

00:23:40.550 --> 00:23:42.420
<i>Next time: "You're My Brother, Aren't You?"</i>

00:23:42.420 --> 00:23:45.010
<i>We await the pleasure</i> <i>of your next visit.</i>
